### Test 1: Update Schedule - Driver
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1201,
  "unitId": 5001,
  "scheduleId": 12,
  "driverId": 102
}

### Test 2: Update Schedule - Move to another unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1201,
  "unitId": 5001,
  "scheduleId": 12,
  "newUnitId": 5002
}
